=== memtest: Q2 physical memory statistics ===

[1] baseline:
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56755  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 4  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 3  shared 0
  [PASS] 0 < free_pages < total_pages
  [PASS] page directory + at least one page table

[2] after sbrk(64 pages) and touching every page:
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56691  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 68  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 67  shared 0
  free_pages dropped by 64 (64 data pages + 0 new page-table pages)
  [PASS] proc_pages grew by 64
  [PASS] free_pages dropped by exactly the touched pages + page tables

[3] fork a child
  child, right after fork:
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56622  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 68  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 67  shared 66
  child, after writing its 64 heap pages:
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56558  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 68  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 67  shared 2
  child: its writes consumed 64 more pages (copies)
  parent, child alive:
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56558  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 68  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 67  shared 2
  fork + child's writes use 133 pages in total while the child is alive
  [PASS] free_pages decreases while the forked child exists
  parent, after child exit + wait():
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56691  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 68  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 67  shared 0
  [PASS] free_pages back to the pre-fork value after the child is reaped
  [PASS] parent's heap data unchanged by the child's writes

[4] release the heap with sbrk(-64 pages)
  after shrinking:
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56755  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 4  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 3  shared 0
  (page-table pages are kept by xv6 until exit: pt_pages 66 -> 66)
  [PASS] free_pages back to the baseline (apart from retained page tables)
  [PASS] proc_pages back to baseline

[5] leak test: 20 x (sbrk + touch, fork, child writes, exit, wait, shrink)
  after the cycles:
  total_pages 57035  free_pages 56755  proc_pages(sz/PGSIZE) 4  pt_pages 66 (user 1)  resident 3  shared 0
  free_pages before 56755, after 56755
  [PASS] no pages leaked over the cycles

memtest: ALL CHECKS PASSED (0 failure(s))
